Z||000000||bHooper||02-19-2000||11:02 PM||||Formula tonite!  I was driving over to my ex girlfriends, when this black Fiero Formula went by me.  I kept my eye on it and noticed it turned into AutoZone, so I stalked it.  This 16 yo kid gets out, and I asked him about his car... it only has 25,000 miles on it!  It was a auto, with a aftermarket sunroof, and he said his dad bought off of their neighbor.<P>Unfortunately, everytime I tried to talk Fiero all he would say is "I'm really a Trans-Am person, have you seen the new one's?" <P>I could tell he wasn't going to be a fiero owner very long, so I gave him my card and told him to call me when he was ready to sell it!<P>||||reg||1
